          "reponse": "Don't"
        },
        {
          "type": "trous",
          "phrase": "___ quiet, please. (be)",
          "reponse": "Be"
        },
        {
          "type": "choix",
          "question": "Pour interdire de mâcher du chewing-gum :",
          "options": [
